{"sourceUrl":"https://www.zy91.com/content/default2/153/10112","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:30.835425+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.zy91.com/content/default2/153/10112","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://www.zy91.com/main\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://www.zy91.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">首页</a><em>&gt;</em>\n<span>\n<a href=\"https://www.zy91.com/content/default2/153/10112\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究生教育</a>\n</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3>浙江大学医学院第一临床医学院关于举办“2026年优秀大学生夏令营”的通知</h3>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>2026-06-10</span>\n<span>15643</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span>为促进全国优秀大学生之间的交流，加强医学相关领域优秀人才对浙江大学医学院第一临床医学院的了解，我院将于</span>7<span>月上旬举办</span></span><strong><span><span>2026</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年临床医学优秀大学生夏令营</span></span></strong><span><span>。本次夏令营活动内容主要包括医院总体情况介绍、学科专业介绍等环节。</span></span></p><p><span><span>浙江大学医学院附属第一医院（简称浙大一院）建院于</span>1947<span>年，由时任浙江大学校长竺可桢教授亲手创建，是浙江大学首家附属医院，首任院长为我国著名内科学、传染病学专家王季午教授。医院现为集医疗、教学、科研于一体的大型现代化三级甲等综合医院，以综合实力雄厚、医疗质量过硬、学科特色鲜明享誉海内外，是国家医学中心建设单位、全国公立医院高质量发展试点单位、国家传染病医学中心、综合类别国家区域医疗中心牵头单位、建立健全现代医院管理制度试点医院、中西医协同</span><span>“</span><span>旗舰</span><span>”</span><span>医院试点项目建设单位。</span></span></p><p><span><span>浙大一院</span></span><strong><span><span>综合实力稳居第一梯队</span></span></strong><span><span>，</span>2026<span>年</span><span>4</span><span>月，国家卫生健康委发布</span><span>2024</span><span>年度全国三级公立医院绩效考核结果，在参评的</span><span>1658</span><span>家三级公立综合医院中连续</span><span>7</span><span>年位列</span><span>A++</span><span>等级，全国前</span><span>1%</span><span>。</span><span>2024</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月，中国医学科学院发布《</span><span>2023</span><span>年度中国医院科技量值（</span><span>STEM</span><span>）》，医院综合排名全国第</span><span>6</span><span>，</span><span>8</span><span>大专科进入全国前</span><span>10</span><span>，传染病学、消化病学双双名列全国第</span><span>1</span><span>名，五年总科技量值排名全国第</span><span>5</span><span>。医院是</span></span><strong><span><span>科技部创新人才培养基地、国家引才引智示范基地</span></span></strong><span><span>。拥有中国工程院院士</span>2<span>人，国家重大引才计划专家</span><span>10</span><span>人，教育部长江特聘教授</span><span>5</span><span>人，国家杰青</span><span>5</span><span>人，国家万人领军</span><span>7</span><span>人，国家级优秀青年人才</span><span>16</span><span>人，浙江省特级专家</span><span>3</span><span>人，浙江大学求是特聘学者</span><span>34</span><span>人。医院拥有</span></span><strong><span><span>国家重点学科</span>2<span>个、国家临床重点专科</span><span>2</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>个（含</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>个建设项目）</span></span></strong><span><span>，在器官移植、传染病、血液病、肾脏病、泌尿系统疾病、临床药学等学科领域享有盛名，是国内开展大器官移植门类最齐全的医学中心之一。医院</span></span><strong><span><span>科研创新实力雄厚</span></span></strong><span><span>，承担了国家科技重大专项、国家重点研发计划、国家自然科学基金等国家级课题，先后获得国家科技进步奖特等奖</span>1<span>项（建国以来教育、卫生系统唯一）、一等奖</span><span>2</span><span>项、二等奖</span><span>9</span><span>项，教育部、中华医学会、浙江省等科技进步一等奖</span><span>40</span><span>余项。医院</span></span><strong><span><span>教学体系完备一流</span></span></strong><span><span>，是首批国家临床教学培训示范中心、国家住院医师规范化培训示范基地、首批国家</span><span>“</span><span>大思政课</span><span>”</span><span>实践教学基地、首批国家外科基础技能提升项目培训基地、</span><span>“</span><span>中国精英教学医院联盟</span><span>”</span><span>创始成员单位，在首届全国高校附属医院临床实践教育质量评价中位列全国第十，浙江第一。</span></span></p><p><span><span>欢迎</span>2026<span>届</span></span><strong><span><span>临床医学专业</span></span></strong><span><span>优秀本科毕业生报名参加本次活动。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>全国高校临床医学等相关专业的</span>2027<span>届优秀本科毕业生（</span><span>2027</span><span>年夏季毕业）；</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>学习成绩优秀，英语水平良好，身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span>3. </span><span><span>欢迎有志参加全国研究生招生考试并有意向攻读我院博士、硕士研究生者申请。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、申请方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>申请者请登录浙江大学研究生招生管理系统，链接地址：</span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login<span>，注册后进行网上报名。系统报名时填写至具体二级招生单位（下拉菜单</span></span><span>中</span><span><span>，单位选择</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>第</span></span><span>一</span><span><span>临床医学院</span></span><span>”</span><span><span>）</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>具体操作详见学生操作手册（附件</span>PDF<span>）；</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>请将所有证明材料原件按以下顺序扫描并整合成</span>PDF<span>（不超过</span><span>10M</span><span>）后，在网申系统</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>附件</span></span><span>”</span><span><span>中上传，文件名为</span></span><span>“</span><strong><span><span>报名二级招生单位</span>-</span></strong><strong><span><span>报名学科（内外科请精确到三级学科）</span></span></strong><strong><span>-<span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span>所在本科院校</span></span></strong><span>”</span><span><span>（示例：</span></span><strong><span><span>第一临床医学院</span>-<span>内科学（心血管病）</span><span>-</span><span>张三</span><span>-XX</span><span>大学</span></span></strong><span><span>）：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）个人身份证（正反面）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）本科成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）总评成绩排名证明（应包含所学专业同年级人数，须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）外语水平证明材料：</span><span>CET-6</span><span>、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>5<span>）其他材料：如已发表论文、各类获奖或资格证书等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>以上所有材料均应真实有效，若发现申请人有弄虚作假行为，取消其申请资格并通报申请人所在本科院校。</span></span></p><p><span>3. </span><span><span>申请截止时间：</span></span><strong><span>6<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>17</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日（周</span></span></strong><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>17</span></span></strong><strong><span>:00<span>前完成系统报名</span></span></strong><span><span>，逾期报名视为无效。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、审核与录取</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>入营资格由我院组织学科及专家审核，择优确定入营名单；</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><strong><span><span>入营名单将于</span>6<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>30</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日公布</span></span></strong><span><span>在夏令营报名系统中，请耐心等待并及时关注夏令营报名系统。</span></span><strong><span><span>入选者需在</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>2</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span>1</span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span>:00<span>前登录夏令营报名系统确认是否参加</span></span></strong><span><span>，逾期未确认视放弃此资格；</span></span></p><p><span>3. </span><span><span>未入选者不另行通知；</span></span></p><p><span><span>表</span>1 <span>浙大一院临床医学优秀大学生夏令营报名录取时间轴</span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span><span>日期</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>内容</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>备注</span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>6<span>月</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span>:00<span>前</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>夏令营报名系统申请（地址：</span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login<span>）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>所有材料均应真实有效</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>6<span>月</span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>入营名单</span></span><span>确认</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>入营结果以夏令营报名系统结果为准，</span></span><strong><span><span>请勿提前以任何形式咨询是否入选</span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span>2<span>日</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span>:00<span>前</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>登录夏令营报名系统确认是否参加</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>逾期未确认视放弃此资格</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span>3<span>日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>关注我院或学科入营具体通知</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>原则上为邮件通知</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><span><span>四、夏令营安排</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>夏令营拟安排在</span>7<span>月上旬</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>具体</span></span><span>形式及日程</span><span><span>以后续邮件通知为准。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>沈</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系方式：</span>fah</span><span>zj</span><span>uad@aliyun.com<span>（工作人员会按照邮件发送时间顺序回复，请勿多次重复发送）</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、注意事项</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>夏令营各项事宜如有更新将会及时公告，敬请关注浙江大学医学院网站（</span>http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/2026/0601/c58749a3168548/page.htm<span>）、浙江大学医学院官方微信号（</span><span>https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/d-ixhyPMqunElizXONhsQw</span><span>）及营员钉钉群（待后续入营邮件通知）相关通知。</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><strong><span><span>本夏令营活动原则上只进行招生宣传，请勿轻信所谓</span><span>“预录取”、“研究生录取资格”“优营直通录取”之类的邮件或电话信息，谨防被骗。</span></span></strong></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>浙江大学医学院附属第一医院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span>6<span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.zy91.com/public/vendor/ueditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://www.zy91.com/upload/20260610/202606101501129702.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"研究生招生管理系统夏令营模块学生操作手册.pdf\">研究生招生管理系统夏令营模块学生操作手册.pdf</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"2bb96ad48c45b53eb9b27d7e840749f4cf66c2e24762ab40a4cd83fd0a719c92","textLength":2420,"sourceSha256":"023a5a8d3defb10f7481c722021767a2785e72102c722a795ac07161960239d7","selector":"article-like:kp-detail kp-detail1-t1","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d45505307dd7eeb4c332","title":"2026年浙江大学医学院第一临床医学院关于举办“2026年优秀大学生夏令营”的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:30.835425+00:00"}
